    <briefdescription>
<para>Length-prefixed array of <computeroutput>M2_string</computeroutput> pointers. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Used to pass a list of strings (variable names, error messages, <computeroutput><ref refid="class_monoid" kindref="compound">Monoid</ref></computeroutput> symbol tables, ...) across the engine boundary. As with its siblings, the <computeroutput><ref refid="struct_m2___array_string__struct_a7242e39feeb72bee6c528eeadb708f8d_1a7242e39feeb72bee6c528eeadb708f8d" kindref="member">array</ref></computeroutput> is a flexible-array member trailing the struct. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
